# canvas-app: soma-messages
# Demo-only parity UI, with native rich-link fixtures from the isolated API branch.
# Soma Messages linked to the Mac's iMessage service (0.6+). Against the service's DEMO on the Mac Pro: sample
# chats only, nothing of Boss's; every send gets a fake reply 2 s later. The harness must inject its ephemeral port/token; the checked-in endpoint fails closed.
shell cmd statusbar collapse
key HOME
# A clean start: not linked yet, no contacts answer.
shell pm clear dev.omalauncher.messages
# Contacts allowed ahead, so Android's prompt (whose title also says Allow) doesn't cover the inbox.
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.READ_CONTACTS
# 0.7+ asks for notifications when linked; granted here so its prompt does not cover the inbox.
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO
# Quoted twice: walk.py hands the line to the phone's shell, which would split the link at '&'.
shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW -d "'soma-messages://link?url=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A1&token=INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN'" dev.omalauncher.messages
wait 2500
# The owner says yes to the Mac by name before anything goes to it.
expect Get your iMessages from 100.120.219.46?
shot link-dialog
tap Link
wait 1500
# Names come from the phone's contacts; the Mac's names stand in when the phone has none.
wait 4000
expect Weekend
expect Ana Demo
absent OpenBubbles
shot inbox-from-the-mac
# Structured replies, separate thread drafts and uncached context. DEMO only.
tap Ana Demo
tap Message
type PARENT-DRAFT
closeime
keyboard hidden
shot parent-before-thread
tap Open reply context
expect Replies
expect Yes! 7pm
expect Perfect, see you there
shot focused-replies card=messages-parity-thread-context
tap Message
type THREAD-DRAFT
closeime
keyboard hidden
expect THREAD-DRAFT
shot thread-draft card=messages-parity-thread-draft
key BACK
expect PARENT-DRAFT
absent THREAD-DRAFT
shot parent-draft-kept
tap Open reply context
expect THREAD-DRAFT
tap Message
key ENTER
wait 3200
expect THREAD-DRAFT
absent Demo reply to: THREAD-DRAFT
shot thread-send
closeime
key BACK
expect PARENT-DRAFT
key BACK
tap Long thread
expect Long #120
tap Open reply context
expect Long #5
expect Long #119
expect Long #120
absent Long #118
shot unloaded-root-and-nested card=messages-parity-thread-context
tap Message
type RESTORE-THREAD-DRAFT
closeime
key BACK
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.messages
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.messages/.MainActivity
tap Long thread
tap Open reply context
expect RESTORE-THREAD-DRAFT
shot restored-thread-draft card=messages-parity-thread-draft
tap Message
key ENTER
wait 3200
expect RESTORE-THREAD-DRAFT
closeime
key BACK
key BACK
tap Sideways
doubletap Photo
expect Show replies
tap Show replies
expect Replies
expect Photo
shot photo-thread card=messages-parity-thread-context
tap Message
type PHOTO-THREAD-REPLY
key ENTER
wait 3200
expect PHOTO-THREAD-REPLY
closeime
expect Replies
expect Record a voice message
tap Record a voice message
wait 2500
tap Stop recording
expect Send voice message
tap Send voice message
wait 3500
expect Voice message, tap to play
shot voice-in-thread
closeime
key BACK
key BACK
expect Messages
# The harness separately checks SSE exact replyTo IDs for text and voice; a quote alone cannot prove it.
